message: "If you use the RISK publication data, analysis scripts, workflows, or software, please cite the Bioinformatics paper."
title: "RISK Publication Data and Analysis Workflows"
abstract: "The RISK publication repository contains processed datasets, analysis scripts, and workflows used to generate the results and figures for the Bioinformatics article introducing RISK, a scalable tool for network annotation and visualization."
